usage: resolve-agents.py [-h] [--agent AGENT] [--division DIVISION]
                         [--agents-file AGENTS_FILE] [--runbook RUNBOOK]
                         [--list-runbooks]

Resolve catalog IDs, display names and runbooks to adapter slugs (stdlib
only).

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --agent AGENT
  --division DIVISION
  --agents-file AGENTS_FILE
  --runbook RUNBOOK
  --list-runbooks
